!id: H7J2D5M0XZ
!front: Discriminant
!back:
If

\[ a x^2 + b x + c = 0 \]

then

\[ \Delta = b^2 - 4ac \]
~~~

!type: Basic Math

!id: dn9wauQWAT
!front: Quadratic Formula
!back:
If

\[ a x^2 + b x + c = 0 \]

then

\[ x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a} \]
~~~

